# Custom App Only

This repository is the custom Frappe app **testapp**. Change only this app. Do not edit, patch, or overwrite standard **Frappe** or **ERPNext** source.

## Allowed

- Files under `testapp/` (DocTypes, hooks, patches, APIs, public assets, fixtures)
- App-level repo files that belong to this app (`pyproject.toml`, tests, CI for this app)

Use Frappe extension points instead of core edits: `hooks.py`, custom DocTypes, Client Scripts, Server Scripts, overrides listed in hooks (`override_doctype_class`, `override_whitelisted_methods`, `doc_events`, `doctype_js`), and fixtures.

## Forbidden

Never modify files in other bench apps, including:

- `apps/frappe/**`
- `apps/erpnext/**`
- Any other standard/third-party app that is not `testapp`

```python
# ❌ BAD — editing Frappe/ERPNext core
# apps/frappe/frappe/model/document.py
# apps/erpnext/erpnext/accounts/doctype/sales_invoice/sales_invoice.py

# ✅ GOOD — extend from this app
# testapp/hooks.py  (doc_events, override_doctype_class, …)
# testapp/testapp/overrides/sales_invoice.py
```

If a request requires changing Frappe or ERPNext core, stop, say so, and implement the equivalent in **testapp** instead.
